{
  "job_B9.7.4_20251003_115119": {
    "chunk_text": "Se H\u00e6lend, \u00fea \u00fea he on heofone asteah, he sealde his \u00feeignen sibbe bebodan, & \u00feuss cw\u00e6\u00f0, He sealde \u00fea farende, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde eft cumende on heom eallen gemeten. \u00de\u00e6re sibbe fr\u00e6tewe se h\u00e6lend on o\u00f0re stowe \u00e6teowde wunderlice, & \u00feuss cw\u00e6\u00f0, eadige by\u00f0 \u00fea Gehere\u00f0 nu, \u00fe\u00e6t se by\u00f0 Godes bearn geceid se \u00fee wyle gesibsum beon, & nele se na beon Godes Se forsac\u00f0 him God to f\u00e6der, se \u00fee sibbe forhoga\u00f0. Ac swa \u00feeh \u00feeos sibb mid \u00fean gode mannen, \u00fee Godes bebodan lufige\u00f0, is to healdene, na mid \u00fean Seo Cristes sibb heo freme\u00f0 to ecere h\u00e6le; seo sibb, \u00fee on deofle is, heo becum\u00f0 to ecere forwyrde. Simle we sculen habben \u00fea sibbe mid \u00fean godan mannen, & gefiht wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re yfelra manna un\u00f0eawes. We sculen fleon \u00fea un\u00f0eawes, na \u00fea m\u00e6nn sylfe, \u00feeh heo yfele seon, for heo synd Godes gesceafte. So\u00f0lice seo sibb, \u00fee on \u00fean goden mannen is, bro\u00f0ra ge\u00f0w\u00e6rnysse & \u00fea so\u00f0e lufe \u00fe\u00e6re nextan heo Seo sibb \u00feone gast synderlice heo geearne\u00f0. Seo sibb is moder \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0e lufe, & heo is halignysse tacn. Beo \u00fe\u00e6re Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00feone witega, Lufie\u00f0 sibb & so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse. Seo sibb by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s folcas h\u00e6le, & \u00fe\u00e6s",
